 4. 🚜 Charted: Farm Belt pain 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: AAA. Chart: Ben Geman/Axios Diesel prices are soaring just as the energy-thirsty peak of harvest season looms for many of the country's largest crops, Axios' Ben Geman writes. 

 Mid-August diesel prices (charted above) are at their highest in the last decade, according to AAA data. Between the lines: It's a double whammy for farmers. The Iran war is also causing much higher fertilizer costs that hit months ago .

