 8. 💂 1 for the road: Britain&#x27;s royal return 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 This morning's covers of Murdoch papers on both sides of the pond. Prince Harry and his wife, Meghan, have decided to return to the United Kingdom, but they won't resume their roles as working members of the royal family.

 The couple's children have already enrolled at British schools for September, according to London's Daily Telegraph . The family plans to live at a private, non-royal residence outside London.

 
 
